WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.968
-Welcome back to "Late Night."

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:02.968
As the Biden presidency

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.270
approaches the five-month mark,

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.571
not everything is perfect,

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:07.140
but one thing we can say
for sure is

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.542
that Biden truly cares
about the American people,

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:12.846
unlike Trump, who only delivered
for himself and his cronies

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:15.682
and who brazenly --
-Oh, here we go again.

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.650
-I'm sorry.
What was that?

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.453
-Oh, nothing. You were busy
linking arms with Jane Fonda

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:22.588
on the Capitol steps.
Go on.

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:24.290
-[ Sigh ]
I'm sorry, everybody.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.924
This is one of our writers,
Matt Goldich,

00:00:25.924 --> 00:00:28.861
and, as you can probably tell,
Matt is conservative.

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:30.496
-Yes, Seth, I'm a conservative

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:32.798
and I'm here to provide
a balanced counterpoint

00:00:32.798 --> 00:00:35.768
to one of your unhinged
virtue signal-logues

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:38.571
about how you're going to move
to Canada, unless the next

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.473
Major League Baseball
All-Star Game

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.175
is played inside a mosque.

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:44.811
[ Laughter ]
-Matt, if you want to provide

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:46.712
your conservative perspective
on the show,

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:48.181
write it up and submit it.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:49.682
Don't just keep interrupting me.

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:52.619
-Oh, I'm sorry for not providing
a safe space for your views,

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:53.986
Ben &amp; Jerry.

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:55.288
[ Laughter ]
I guess this

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:56.689
intellectual back-and-forth

00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:58.324
is a little more difficult
to navigate

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.760
than those Hamptons
fundraisers you go to

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.763
with Walter Mondale
and Bella Abzug.

00:01:04.763 --> 00:01:06.298
[ Laughter ]
-Matt, I'm pretty sure both

00:01:06.298 --> 00:01:07.800
of those people are dead.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:09.969
-Well, thank you, bail reform.

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:12.005
[ Laughter ]
-Matt, I don't even care

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:13.373
that you're interrupting
the show,

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:15.841
as long as you don't show
that long graphics package

00:01:15.841 --> 00:01:17.076
that makes it look like
you're one

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:19.312
of the great conservative
luminaries of our time.

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:22.481
-Ah, you must be the one that
lets people know it's time for

00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:24.983
"The Conservative Perspective."

00:01:24.983 --> 00:01:27.987
[ Somber march plays ]

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:37.196
♪♪

00:01:37.196 --> 00:01:47.206
♪♪

00:01:47.206 --> 00:01:57.216
♪♪

00:01:57.216 --> 00:02:03.722
♪♪

00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:05.358
-Oh, I really hate that
so much, buddy.

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:06.859
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:08.861
There's like five or six times
you think it's over

00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:10.263
and then, it just keeps going.

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.730
Say what you want
about Joe Biden,

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.533
but he's delivered
tangible results

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:15.301
for the American people,
while presenting

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:18.337
real solutions --
-Oh, here we go.

00:02:18.337 --> 00:02:20.173
[ Laughter ]
-Wait. What was that?

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:22.141
-Oh, nothing.
I was just listening to you

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:24.244
do the bidding
of the banking industry

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:26.912
and slobber all
over "Oldman" Sachs,

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:31.016
instead of supporting the
political revolution we need!

00:02:31.016 --> 00:02:33.386
-Alright. This is another
one of our writers, Sal Gentile.

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:36.155
And let me guess, Sal.
You're a progressive?

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:39.325
-Uh, yeah, Seth,
I'm a progressive.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:40.994
I don't know if you've
ever met a real one

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:43.596
at one of those CPAC
conferences you attend

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:46.499
with Milton Friedman
and John McLaughlin.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:49.169
-I know both of those
people are dead.

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:52.238
-Well, thank you,
private health insurance!

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:53.639
[ Laughter ]
Seth, it's time

00:02:53.639 --> 00:02:56.108
for a new voice on your show.

00:02:56.108 --> 00:02:59.245
It's time for
"The Progressive Perspective"!

