00:03:35.914 --> 00:03:37.049
-And that also sucks.

00:03:37.049 --> 00:03:38.918
You can't like keep
cutting back to you,

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:41.087
making people think it's over.

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:42.088
Never mind.

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:43.355
Sal, so let me
get this straight.

00:03:43.355 --> 00:03:44.824
You're saying that,
because Joe Biden

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:47.593
isn't a true blue,
dyed-in-the-wool progressive,

00:03:47.593 --> 00:03:50.129
