to the Republican-led Stone Age?

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.203
-Uh...

00:03:57.203 --> 00:04:01.908
Well, you see --

00:04:01.908 --> 00:04:04.711
Alright, look, Seth, I'm not
really that extreme, okay?

00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:06.078
-You're not?

00:04:06.078 --> 00:04:09.214
-No, of course I support whoever
the Democrat in charge is,

00:04:09.214 --> 00:04:12.552
even if it is Joe Biden,
an out-of-touch, old white guy.

00:04:12.552 --> 00:04:15.454
I mean, I already work
for one of those.

00:04:15.454 --> 00:04:17.723
-Gee, thanks, Sal.

00:04:17.723 --> 00:04:18.924
-Talking about you, Seth.

00:04:18.924 --> 00:04:21.427
[ Laughter ]
-I know. I know.

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:23.796
-Anyway, I was just hoping
to make a big splash

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:27.033
and parlay the, you know,
this whole thing into a gig,

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:29.936
writing a newsletter that makes
eight figures on Substack.

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:31.137
-What is Substack?

00:04:31.137 --> 00:04:33.639
-I don't know!
Nobody knows!

00:04:33.639 --> 00:04:36.041
-Sal, you don't need to pretend
you're something you're not.

00:04:36.041 --> 00:04:38.845
Just be yourself.

00:04:38.845 --> 00:04:41.347
-Really?
Um...

00:04:41.347 --> 00:04:43.950
But that's just a guy
who's like super angry

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.484
about the Mets all the time.

00:04:45.484 --> 00:04:46.919
-Yeah, but aren't they like
good this year?

00:04:46.919 --> 00:04:48.655
-For now.

00:04:48.655 --> 00:04:50.289
-But the roster's
pretty strong, though.

00:04:50.289 --> 00:04:51.891
-They're gonna
[bleep] it up, Seth!

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:55.160
[ Laughter ]

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.096
-That's fine.
Just, you know.

00:04:57.096 --> 00:05:00.732
-[ Sigh ]
-Just be Sal Gentile.

00:05:00.732 --> 00:05:03.002
-Alright, well,

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:05.871
in that case, it's time
for "The Gentile Perspective."

